<style>
	.nav-transparent {
		transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
	}

	.nav-solid {
		transform: translateY(-100%);
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		transition: transform 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), opacity 0.3s ease;
	}

	[data-header].scrolled .nav-transparent {
		opacity: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	[data-header].scrolled .nav-solid {
		transform: translateY(0);
		opacity: 1;
		pointer-events: auto;
	}

	[data-header].no-transition .nav-transparent,
	[data-header].no-transition .nav-solid {
		transition: none !important;
	}

	.nav-solid-bar {
		box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(10,26,52,0.25), 0 8px 16px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
	}

	/* Free shipping tab (phones; PDP clean brief, 22 Oct). Part of the navy
	   nav it hangs from, under the logo: it moves with the nav and has no
	   motion of its own (Tom, 22 Oct). Concave fillets join the nav to the
	   tab. Tab and fillets start 1px up inside the nav: where the nav's edge
	   falls between device pixels (125% display scaling) the nav and the
	   tab would each half-cover that row and leave a light seam. */
	.header-tab::before,
	.header-tab::after {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		top: 0;
		width: 0.75rem;
		height: calc(0.75rem + 1px);
	}
	.header-tab::before {
		right: 100%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 0 100%, transparent 0.72rem, var(--color-main) 0.75rem);
	}
	.header-tab::after {
		left: 100%;
		background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 100%, transparent 0.72rem, var(--color-main) 0.75rem);
	}
	/* One soft shadow under the navy nav and its tab together. */
	.header-shadow {
		filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 10px color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-main) 16%, transparent));
	}
	@media (max-width: 767.98px) {
		/* Page load: the top nav, and the tab with it, slides down. */
		.nav-transparent {
			animation: header-drop 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) backwards;
		}
		.nav-solid {
			transition-duration: 0.5s, 0.3s;
		}
		.nav-solid-bar {
			box-shadow: none;
		}
	}
	@media (min-width: 768px) {
		.header-shadow {
			filter: none;
		}
	}
	@keyframes header-drop {
		from { transform: translateY(-100%); }
	}
	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.nav-transparent {
			animation: none;
			transition: none;
		}
	}

	/* Mobile menu animation */
	[data-mobile-menu] {
		transition: opacity 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;
	}
	[data-mobile-menu].menu-closed {
		opacity: 0;
		transform: translateY(-8px);
		pointer-events: none;
	}
	[data-mobile-menu].menu-open {
		opacity: 1;
		transform: translateY(0);
		pointer-events: auto;
	}
</style>

{%- comment -%}
	Free shipping tab, phones only, hung under the logo of a navy nav row (the
	styles above): the floating nav on every page, and the top nav where that
	is navy (product pages). A see-through top nav has no edge to hang it from,
	so there it first shows when the floating nav slides in.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture shipping_tab -%}
	<div class="md:hidden absolute top-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2">
		<p class="header-tab relative -mt-px flex items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap rounded-b-xl bg-main px-3.5 pt-1 pb-1.75 font-body text-xs font-bold leading-4 text-white">
			{%- render 'icon-truck', classes: 'size-3.5 shrink-0' -%}
			{{- 'general.free_shipping_short' | t -}}
		</p>
	</div>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign navy_top = false -%}
{%- if request.page_type == 'product' -%}{%- assign navy_top = true -%}{%- endif -%}

{%- comment -%}
	Sale banner (Theme settings > Sale bar; design 2J, 14 Nov): an oxblood
	band above the nav on every page, the whole band one link (to the kit
	page unless the setting names another). It sits in the page flow, so it
	scrolls away with the page, and it is there at first paint, so nothing
	shifts.
	Behind: the banner's words, large and a shade darker than the band, with
	the aira mark between repeats, drifting right to left (left to right in
	Arabic). CSS only, decorative and hidden from screen readers, which get
	the words once from the visually hidden line; still under reduced motion.
	The repeats are drawn by CSS from an attribute, so the page's text holds
	the words once, not once per repeat, and find-in-page does not land on
	the moving copies.
	The track is two identical halves, each wider than any screen, moved by
	half its own width, so the loop has no seam. The repeats per half follow
	the words' length, so a short custom line still fills a wide screen, and
	the loop's seconds follow what it carries, so the pace stays the design's
	(three repeats of the default line in the setting's seconds). The
	track is anchored to the physical left because the transform that moves
	it is physical; Arabic reverses the animation instead.
	In front: the offer in three parts, sentence case. From 768px the whole
	line is one cream pill. On phones (Tom, 14 Nov) only the bold part is
	the pill and the words either side sit on the band in the pill's cream,
	so the line is lighter over the narrow band; the three share a baseline.
	Capitals and letter-spacing are for Latin text only (hard rule 10: none
	on Arabic), so they hang on the ltr variant.
	The words' small upward nudge centres their ink on the mark and the
	band, measured from the painted pixels with the theme's own font files:
	the capitals in English, the letters' full height in Arabic (Almarai sits
	lower on the line and would touch the band's bottom edge). The pill's
	desktop padding is 7px over 6px for the same reason.
	Words and colours come from the theme strings and the colour tokens; a
	setting left blank changes nothing. The deep red is the band's own
	colour mixed 30% towards black, so it follows the band. The mark is the
	header's logo file used as a mask, so it takes that colour.
	The header is fixed to the top of the screen and its section wrapper has
	no height (.shopify-section-group-header-group in critical.source.css).
	With the bar on, the wrapper takes the bar's height and sticks exactly
	that far above the top instead, and the header hangs under it: at the top
	of the page the nav sits below the bar, and once the bar has scrolled
	out the nav holds the place the fixed header has. The bar is drawn over
	the header, so on phones the nav slides down from under it on load.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
	assign sale_bar = false
	if settings.sale_bar_enabled
		assign sale_bar = true
		assign sale_bar_kit = all_products['aira-kit']
		assign sale_bar_url = settings.sale_bar_link | default: sale_bar_kit.url | default: routes.root_url

		# Words: the theme strings, in the visitor's language, unless a setting holds its own.
		assign sale_bar_words = 'sections.header.sale_bar_title' | t
		if settings.sale_bar_words != blank
			assign sale_bar_words = settings.sale_bar_words | escape
		endif
		assign sale_bar_lead = 'sections.header.sale_bar_offer_lead' | t
		if settings.sale_bar_offer_lead != blank
			assign sale_bar_lead = settings.sale_bar_offer_lead | escape
		endif
		assign sale_bar_main = 'sections.header.sale_bar_offer_main' | t
		if settings.sale_bar_offer_main != blank
			assign sale_bar_main = settings.sale_bar_offer_main | escape
		endif
		assign sale_bar_tail = 'sections.header.sale_bar_offer_tail' | t
		if settings.sale_bar_offer_tail != blank
			assign sale_bar_tail = settings.sale_bar_offer_tail | escape
		endif

		# Colours: the tokens, unless a swatch is set (a cleared swatch is see-through, so it counts as unset).
		assign sale_bar_color = 'var(--color-oxblood)'
		if settings.sale_bar_color != blank and settings.sale_bar_color.alpha > 0
			assign sale_bar_color = settings.sale_bar_color
		endif
		assign sale_bar_deep = 'color-mix(in srgb, var(--sale-bar-color) 70%, black)'
		if settings.sale_bar_color_deep != blank and settings.sale_bar_color_deep.alpha > 0
			assign sale_bar_deep = settings.sale_bar_color_deep
		endif
		assign sale_bar_pill = 'var(--color-secondary)'
		if settings.sale_bar_color_pill != blank and settings.sale_bar_color_pill.alpha > 0
			assign sale_bar_pill = settings.sale_bar_color_pill
		endif
		assign sale_bar_pill_text = 'var(--sale-bar-color)'
		if settings.sale_bar_color_pill_text != blank and settings.sale_bar_color_pill_text.alpha > 0
			assign sale_bar_pill_text = settings.sale_bar_color_pill_text
		endif

		# Repeats per half. A repeat (the words and a mark) runs about 47px a character at the desktop
		# size and 31px on phones, less in Arabic. A half has to outrun the widest screen: 5120px from
		# 768px up, 767px below that, where the design's three repeats do it.
		assign sale_bar_unit = sale_bar_words.size | plus: 2
		assign sale_bar_repeats = 139 | plus: sale_bar_unit | divided_by: sale_bar_unit | at_least: 4 | at_most: 24
		assign sale_bar_repeats_phone = 31 | plus: sale_bar_unit | divided_by: sale_bar_unit | at_least: 3 | at_most: sale_bar_repeats
		# The setting is the designed pace: its seconds carry three repeats of the default line (60
		# characters with their marks) across, so a loop that carries more takes longer in proportion.
		assign sale_bar_seconds = settings.sale_bar_duration | default: 50
		assign sale_bar_loop = sale_bar_seconds | times: sale_bar_repeats | times: sale_bar_unit | divided_by: 60.0 | round
		assign sale_bar_loop_phone = sale_bar_seconds | times: sale_bar_repeats_phone | times: sale_bar_unit | divided_by: 60.0 | round
	endif
-%}
{%- if sale_bar -%}
	<style>
		#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
			position: sticky;
			top: calc(var(--spacing) * -21);
			z-index: 50;
			height: auto;
			--sale-bar-color: {{ sale_bar_color }};
			--sale-bar-deep: {{ sale_bar_deep }};
			--sale-bar-pill: {{ sale_bar_pill }};
			--sale-bar-pill-text: {{ sale_bar_pill_text }};
		}
		@media (min-width: 768px) {
			#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
				top: calc(var(--spacing) * -22);
			}
		}
		#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar {
			background-color: var(--sale-bar-color);
		}
		#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-track {
			left: 0;
			color: var(--sale-bar-deep);
			animation: sale-bar-scroll {{ sale_bar_loop_phone }}s linear infinite;
		}
		@media (min-width: 768px) {
			#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-track {
				animation-duration: {{ sale_bar_loop }}s;
			}
		}
		[dir="rtl"] #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-track {
			animation-direction: reverse;
		}
		#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-word::before {
			content: attr(data-words);
		}
		#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-mark {
			background-color: currentColor;
			-webkit-mask: url("{{ 'aira-logo-only-white.svg' | asset_url }}") center / contain no-repeat;
			mask: url("{{ 'aira-logo-only-white.svg' | asset_url }}") center / contain no-repeat;
		}
		#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-offer {
			--sale-bar-shadow: 0 6px 18px color-mix(in srgb, color-mix(in srgb, var(--sale-bar-color) 33%, black) 32%, transparent);
			color: var(--sale-bar-pill);
		}
		#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-offer-main {
			background-color: var(--sale-bar-pill);
			color: var(--sale-bar-pill-text);
			box-shadow: var(--sale-bar-shadow);
		}
		@media (min-width: 768px) {
			#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-offer {
				background-color: var(--sale-bar-pill);
				color: var(--sale-bar-pill-text);
				box-shadow: var(--sale-bar-shadow);
			}
			#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-offer-main {
				background-color: transparent;
				box-shadow: none;
			}
		}
		@keyframes sale-bar-scroll {
			to { transform: translateX(-50%); }
		}
		@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
			#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .sale-bar-track {
				animation: none;
			}
		}
	</style>
	{%- capture sale_bar_half -%}
		<span class="flex items-center gap-4.5 pe-4.5 md:gap-6.5 md:pe-6.5">
			{%- for i in (1..sale_bar_repeats) -%}
				{%- comment -%} Phones carry only the repeats they need; the rest take no room there. {%- endcomment -%}
				{%- if i > sale_bar_repeats_phone -%}{%- assign sale_bar_extra = ' max-md:hidden' -%}{%- else -%}{%- assign sale_bar_extra = '' -%}{%- endif -%}
				<span class="sale-bar-word relative -top-[0.01em] rtl:-top-[0.12em] text-[50px] md:text-[76px] leading-none font-black whitespace-nowrap ltr:uppercase ltr:tracking-[0.02em]{{ sale_bar_extra }}" data-words="{{ sale_bar_words }}"></span>
				<span class="sale-bar-mark h-5.75 w-7.5 shrink-0 md:h-9 md:w-11.5{{ sale_bar_extra }}"></span>
			{%- endfor -%}
		</span>
	{%- endcapture -%}
	<a
		href="{{ sale_bar_url }}"
		class="sale-bar relative z-10 flex h-21 md:h-22 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden font-heading focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:-outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white"
		data-sale-bar
	>
		<span class="sr-only">{{ sale_bar_words }}</span>
		<span class="sale-bar-track pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 flex w-max will-change-transform" aria-hidden="true" data-sale-bar-track>
			{{- sale_bar_half -}}
			{{- sale_bar_half -}}
		</span>
		<p class="sale-bar-offer relative z-10 flex items-baseline gap-2 whitespace-nowrap md:gap-1.5 md:rounded-full md:px-5 md:pt-1.75 md:pb-1.5" data-sale-bar-offer>
			<span class="text-sm leading-[normal] font-bold md:text-base md:font-semibold">{{ sale_bar_lead }}</span>
			<span class="sale-bar-offer-main rounded-full px-3 pt-0.75 pb-1 text-lg leading-none font-black md:p-0 md:text-[23px] ltr:tracking-[-0.01em]">{{ sale_bar_main }}</span>
			<span class="text-sm leading-[normal] font-bold md:text-base md:font-semibold">{{ sale_bar_tail }}</span>
		</p>
	</a>
{%- endif -%}

<header data-header class="{% if sale_bar %}absolute top-full inset-x-0{% else %}fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50{% endif %}">

	{%- comment -%} ── Transparent nav — visible at page top ── {%- endcomment -%}
	<div class="nav-transparent {% if navy_top %}bg-main header-shadow{% else %}pt-2{% endif %}">
		<div class="container-contained relative flex items-center gap-4 md:gap-10 py-3" data-header-row="transparent">

			{%- comment -%} Mobile: hamburger at the start side {%- endcomment -%}
			<button
				class="md:hidden flex items-center text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
				aria-label="{{ 'general.open_menu' | t }}"
				data-mobile-toggle
			>
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"/>
				</svg>
			</button>

			{%- comment -%} Logo — centred on mobile, left on desktop {%- endcomment -%}
			<a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="flex items-center shrink-0 md:shrink md:grow-0 absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 md:static md:translate-x-0">
				<img
					src="{{ 'aira-logo-only-white.svg' | asset_url }}"
					alt="aira"
					class="h-7 w-auto md:hidden"
					width="28"
					height="28"
					loading="eager"
				>
				<img
					src="{{ 'aira-logo-text-white.svg' | asset_url }}"
					alt="aira"
					class="h-7 w-auto -translate-y-0.5 hidden md:block"
					width="120"
					height="28"
					loading="eager"
				>
			</a>

			{%- comment -%} Nav links — white text (desktop only) {%- endcomment -%}
			{%- if section.settings.menu != blank -%}
				<nav class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center gap-8 flex-1">
					{%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
						{%- if link.links != empty -%}
							<div class="relative group">
								{%- comment -%} Parent with children = dropdown toggle only, never a link {%- endcomment -%}
								<span
									class="flex items-center gap-1 cursor-default text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-60 {% if link.active %}opacity-100{% else %}opacity-75{% endif %}"
								>
									{{ link.title }}
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="mt-0.5 transition-transform group-hover:rotate-180">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
									</svg>
								</span>
								<div class="absolute top-full left-0 right-0 h-3"></div>
								<div
									class="absolute top-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-3 hidden group-hover:flex flex-col gap-1 py-3 px-2 rounded-2xl min-w-44 bg-secondary"
									style="box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(10,26,52,0.18), 0 4px 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);"
								>
									{%- for child in link.links -%}
										<a
											href="{{ child.url }}"
											class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap transition-colors hover:bg-main hover:text-secondary {% if child.active %}text-main{% else %}text-main/75{% endif %}"
										>
											{{ child.title }}
										</a>
									{%- endfor -%}
								</div>
							</div>
						{%- else -%}
							<a
								href="{{ link.url }}"
								class="text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-60 {% if link.active %}opacity-100{% else %}opacity-75{% endif %}"
							>
								{{ link.title }}
							</a>
						{%- endif -%}
					{%- endfor -%}
				</nav>
			{%- endif -%}

			{%- comment -%} End side (right in English, left in Arabic): CTA + icons {%- endcomment -%}
			<div class="flex items-center gap-4 ms-auto">

				{%- if section.settings.cta_label != blank -%}
					{%- render 'cta-button',
						label: section.settings.cta_label,
						url: section.settings.cta_url,
						variant: 'shop',
						extra_classes: '!hidden md:!inline-block whitespace-nowrap'
					-%}
				{%- endif -%}

				{%- render 'language-switcher', id: 'header-dark-desktop', text_class: 'text-white', form_class: 'hidden md:flex items-center gap-2' -%}

				<a
					href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
					data-cart-toggle
					class="relative flex items-center text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
				>
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z"/>
					</svg>
					<span data-cart-count-bubble class="absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-highlight text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold leading-none {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}hidden{% endif %}">
						<span data-cart-count>{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
					</span>
				</a>

			</div>
			{%- if navy_top -%}
				{{ shipping_tab }}
			{%- endif -%}
		</div>

		{%- comment -%}
			Desktop: free shipping and the guarantee as a cream strip under the
			nav (PDP clean brief, 22 Oct, option 1). Part of the top row, so it
			leaves with it once the floating nav takes over on scroll. Only under
			a navy top nav (product pages): over a see-through nav and the hero
			behind it, it goes (Tom, 22 Oct), like the phone tab.
		{%- endcomment -%}
		{%- if navy_top -%}
			<div class="hidden md:flex h-9 items-center justify-center gap-3.5 bg-secondary font-body text-[13.5px] text-main" data-header-notice>
				<p class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
					{%- render 'icon-truck', classes: 'size-3.75 shrink-0' -%}
					<span class="[&_strong]:font-bold">{{ 'general.header_free_shipping_html' | t }}</span>
				</p>
				<span class="opacity-45" aria-hidden="true">·</span>
				<p class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
					{%- render 'icon-shield', classes: 'size-3.75 shrink-0' -%}
					<strong class="font-bold">{{ 'snippets.cart_drawer.guarantee' | t }}</strong>
				</p>
			</div>
		{%- endif -%}
	</div>

	{%- comment -%}
		── Solid nav — slides in on scroll ──
		Cream on desktop. On phones it turns navy, with the white logo and
		icons, so the free shipping tab hangs from it as from the top nav.
	{%- endcomment -%}
	<div class="nav-solid absolute top-0 inset-x-0 pt-2">
		<div class="container-contained">
		<div
			class="nav-solid-bar header-shadow relative w-full bg-main md:bg-secondary rounded-2xl flex items-center gap-4 md:gap-10 px-6 py-3"
			data-header-row="solid"
		>

			{%- comment -%} Mobile: hamburger at the start side {%- endcomment -%}
			<button
				class="md:hidden flex items-center text-white transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
				aria-label="{{ 'general.open_menu' | t }}"
				data-mobile-toggle
			>
				<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
					<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5"/>
				</svg>
			</button>

			{%- comment -%} Logo — centred on mobile, left on desktop {%- endcomment -%}
			<a href="{{ routes.root_url }}" class="flex items-center shrink-0 absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 md:static md:translate-x-0">
				<img
					src="{{ 'aira-logo-only-white.svg' | asset_url }}"
					alt="aira"
					class="h-7 w-auto md:hidden"
					width="28"
					height="28"
					loading="eager"
				>
				<img
					src="{{ 'aira-logo-text-blue.svg' | asset_url }}"
					alt="aira"
					class="h-7 w-auto -translate-y-0.5 hidden md:block"
					width="120"
					height="28"
					loading="eager"
				>
			</a>

			{%- comment -%} Nav links (desktop only) {%- endcomment -%}
			{%- if section.settings.menu != blank -%}
				<nav class="hidden md:flex items-center justify-center gap-8 flex-1">
					{%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
						{%- if link.links != empty -%}
							<div class="relative group">
								{%- comment -%} Parent with children = dropdown toggle only, never a link {%- endcomment -%}
								<span
									class="flex items-center gap-1 cursor-default text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-main transition-opacity hover:opacity-60 {% if link.active %}opacity-100{% else %}opacity-75{% endif %}"
								>
									{{ link.title }}
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="14" height="14" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" class="mt-0.5 transition-transform group-hover:rotate-180">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
									</svg>
								</span>
								<div class="absolute top-full left-0 right-0 h-3"></div>
								<div
									class="absolute top-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 translate-y-3 hidden group-hover:flex flex-col gap-1 py-3 px-2 rounded-2xl min-w-44 bg-secondary"
									style="box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(10,26,52,0.18), 0 4px 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);"
								>
									{%- for child in link.links -%}
										<a
											href="{{ child.url }}"
											class="px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap transition-colors hover:bg-main hover:text-secondary {% if child.active %}text-main{% else %}text-main/75{% endif %}"
										>
											{{ child.title }}
										</a>
									{%- endfor -%}
								</div>
							</div>
						{%- else -%}
							<a
								href="{{ link.url }}"
								class="text-base font-bold tracking-wide text-main transition-opacity hover:opacity-60 {% if link.active %}opacity-100{% else %}opacity-75{% endif %}"
							>
								{{ link.title }}
							</a>
						{%- endif -%}
					{%- endfor -%}
				</nav>
			{%- endif -%}

			{%- comment -%} End side (right in English, left in Arabic): CTA + icons {%- endcomment -%}
			<div class="flex items-center gap-4 ms-auto">

				{%- if section.settings.cta_label != blank -%}
					{%- render 'cta-button',
						label: section.settings.cta_label,
						url: section.settings.cta_url,
						variant: 'shop',
						extra_classes: '!hidden md:!inline-block whitespace-nowrap'
					-%}
				{%- endif -%}

				{%- render 'language-switcher', id: 'header-light-desktop', text_class: 'text-main', form_class: 'hidden md:flex items-center gap-2' -%}

				<a
					href="{{ routes.cart_url }}"
					data-cart-toggle
					class="relative flex items-center text-white md:text-main transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
				>
					<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="22" height="22" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75">
						<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 3h1.386c.51 0 .955.343 1.087.835l.383 1.437M7.5 14.25a3 3 0 00-3 3h15.75m-12.75-3h11.218c1.121-2.3 2.1-4.684 2.924-7.138a60.114 60.114 0 00-16.536-1.84M7.5 14.25L5.106 5.272M6 20.25a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0zm12.75 0a.75.75 0 11-1.5 0 .75.75 0 011.5 0z"/>
					</svg>
					<span data-cart-count-bubble class="absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-highlight text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[10px] font-bold leading-none {% if cart.item_count == 0 %}hidden{% endif %}">
						<span data-cart-count>{{ cart.item_count }}</span>
					</span>
				</a>

			</div>
			{{ shipping_tab }}
		</div>
		</div>
	</div>

	{%- comment -%} Mobile menu dropdown {%- endcomment -%}
	{%- if section.settings.menu != blank -%}
		<div
			data-mobile-menu
			class="menu-closed absolute top-full inset-x-0 mt-2 container-contained md:hidden"
		><div class="rounded-2xl px-6 py-5 flex flex-col gap-1 shadow-lg bg-secondary"
		>
			{%- for link in section.settings.menu.links -%}
				{%- if link.links != empty -%}
					{%- comment -%} Parent with children = label only, never a link {%- endcomment -%}
					<span class="block text-lg font-bold py-2.5 text-main cursor-default">
						{{ link.title }}
					</span>
				{%- else -%}
					<a
						href="{{ link.url }}"
						class="block text-lg font-bold py-2.5 text-main transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
					>
						{{ link.title }}
					</a>
				{%- endif -%}
				{%- if link.links != empty -%}
					{%- for child in link.links -%}
						<a
							href="{{ child.url }}"
							class="block text-base font-medium py-2 pl-4 text-main opacity-65 transition-opacity hover:opacity-60"
						>
							{{ child.title }}
						</a>
					{%- endfor -%}
				{%- endif -%}
			{%- endfor -%}
			{%- render 'language-switcher', id: 'header-mobile', text_class: 'text-main', form_class: 'flex items-center gap-2 py-2.5' -%}
			</div>
		</div>
	{%- endif -%}
</header>

<script>
(function() {
	var header = document.querySelector('[data-header]');
	if (!header) return;

	var menu = header.querySelector('[data-mobile-menu]');
	var scrolled = false;

	function closeMenu() {
		if (menu) {
			menu.classList.remove('menu-open');
			menu.classList.add('menu-closed');
		}
	}

	function toggleMenu() {
		if (!menu) return;
		var isOpen = menu.classList.contains('menu-open');
		if (isOpen) {
			closeMenu();
		} else {
			menu.classList.remove('menu-closed');
			menu.classList.add('menu-open');
		}
	}

	header.querySelectorAll('[data-mobile-toggle]').forEach(function(btn) {
		btn.addEventListener('click', toggleMenu);
	});

	function update() {
		var isScrolled = window.scrollY > 50;
		if (isScrolled === scrolled) return;
		scrolled = isScrolled;
		header.classList.toggle('scrolled', scrolled);
		closeMenu();
	}

	if (window.scrollY > 50) {
		header.classList.add('scrolled', 'no-transition');
		scrolled = true;
		requestAnimationFrame(function() {
			requestAnimationFrame(function() {
				header.classList.remove('no-transition');
			});
		});
	}

	window.addEventListener('scroll', update, { passive: true });
})();
</script>

{% schema %}
{
	"name": "Header",
	"settings": [
		{
			"type": "image_picker",
			"id": "logo",
			"label": "Logo",
			"info": "Displays shop name as text if left blank."
		},
		{
			"type": "link_list",
			"id": "menu",
			"label": "Navigation menu",
			"default": "main-menu"
		},
		{
			"type": "header",
			"content": "CTA button"
		},
		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "cta_label",
			"label": "Button label",
			"default": "Get my kit"
		},
		{
			"type": "url",
			"id": "cta_url",
			"label": "Button URL"
		},
		{
			"type": "paragraph",
			"content": "Colors are controlled in Theme settings → Brand colors."
		}
	]
}
{% endschema %}
